{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國反腐機構周一表示，將對舉報年度大學入學考試作弊行為者提供最高5億韓元（約合370888美元）的獎勵。此舉正值當局加大力度打擊利用人工智能（AI）進行作弊的行為之際。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587772.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.386957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:56:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"69e51fa7392dbd8a0e544045ae96c6c00c47fd37a5f1bc25f7f3c55626c2a00d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}